  "ingredients": [
    "2 large eggs, beaten",
    "0.25 cup water",
    "1.5 cups Italian seasoned bread crumbs",
    "0.5 teaspoon garlic salt",
    "0.66666668653488 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.33333334326744 cup cornstarch",
    "2 cups oil for frying, or as needed",
    "1 (16 ounce) package mozzarella cheese sticks"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/54b6kXqLSfCIoO5OkGkTL2uJ38M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23596-fried-mozzarella-cheese-sticks-DDMFS-step01-92-4-82bd5fbdebb148f39886e850debb9784.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23596/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs and water together in a small bowl. Combine bread crumbs and garlic salt in a medium bowl. Whisk flour and cornstarch together in a third bowl. Heat oil in a deep fryer or large, heavy saucepan to 365 degrees F (185 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0b5NiRaEVw_8eywtbi9WcVQQZTo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23596-fried-mozzarella-cheese-sticks-DDMFS-step02-94-4-e65a654e718a48b2b00e8223e7ca5adb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23596/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dredge 1 mozzarella stick in flour mixture; shake off excess. Dip into egg mixture; allow excess to drip off. Press into bread crumbs to coat; repeat dipping in egg and bread crumbs to create a double coating. Place breaded mozzarella stick on a parchment-lined baking sheet. Repeat with remaining mozzarella sticks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x-pAIPeb2F8d6aKnYBoieoO9yIg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23596-fried-mozzarella-cheese-sticks-DDMFS-step03-96-4-b35054e319554854b055e6a58c9cacaa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23596/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Freeze until firm to help coating set and prevent cheese from oozing during frying, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully lower frozen mozzarella sticks, in batches of 3 to 4 at a time, into the hot oil using a spider spoon or tongs. Fry until golden brown, 1 to 2 minutes, flipping occasionally for even color. Avoid overcrowding the pan to maintain oil temperature. Transfer fried mozzarella sticks with a spider spoon or tongs to paper towels; drain. Repeat with remaining mozzarella sticks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RNSPYzD13MnBkFRiMLhCttTdI3M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23596-fried-mozzarella-cheese-sticks-DDMFS-step04-117-4-4d96d2c76fc8491ca2bcfce7e79460a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23596/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BeV2hKihyqT4sQBI6h2fYp2KzuU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23596-fried-mozzarella-cheese-sticks-DDMFS-4x3-842a0eaebf6b435a8d3a8b04325e13eb.jpg"
